# No agent comments

Do not add comments when making code changes.

- No explanatory, narrative, or "why this works" comments
- No JSDoc/`/** ... */` on new or edited APIs unless the user explicitly asks
- No JSX `{/* ... */}` comments describing patterns or intent
- Prefer clear names and structure over comments

**Allowed:** section divider comments only:

```css
/* ---------- Title ---------- */
```

Use them sparingly in large compound/barrel files for navigation. Do not invent other divider styles (`=====`, `———`, `// data`, etc.) — convert to this form when editing. If unsure whether a divider is needed, omit it.
